  "idea": "How to extract text from a screenshot or image without retyping it",
  "text": "The built-in tool on your computer that grabs text from any image in two clicks. When clients email an image of a contract, typing paragraphs from scratch feels agonizing. Rekeying uncopyable text line by line delays projects and introduces avoidable spelling errors. Capture the area with Snipping Tool or Mac Preview, then tap Text Actions to extract characters. It pastes editable text into your documents within two seconds.",
